<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The reality? Using the WhatsApp API to send messages isn’t that complicated once you understand its two pathways. You can integrate directly with Meta&#8217;s Cloud API and develop it yourself, or use a no-code solution and send your first message in just a few minutes.</span></p>
