<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In this article, we will learn </span><b>how to send messages using WhatsApp Business API</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, message types, setup requirements, automation strategies, and common mistakes to avoid.</span></p>
<h2 id="what-is-whatsapp-business-api-messaging"><b>What is WhatsApp Business API Messaging?</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">WhatsApp Business API messaging lets businesses send messages automatically instead of typing each one manually. It connects  WhatsApp with your CRM, </span><a href="/auth/register"><span style="font-weight: 400;">AI-powered chatbot</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, and third-party tools to send personalized order updates, reminders, and promotional messages.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Once you get connected, you can trigger messages by customer action, schedule them in advance, or send them with just a few clicks. Here&#8217;s how a message actually gets sent:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your business sends a request with the message content to the customer. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Meta checks certain rules like whether the template is approved and whether the 24-hour window is still open or not. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Then the message gets delivered, and it sends back a status update to let you know if it is delivered, read, or failed.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The free WhatsApp Business App is good for smaller brands, but has a cap of 256 contacts for broadcast, limited devices, and no automation. With </span><a href="/auth/register"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Meta WhatsApp Business API</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, all these hurdles are eliminated, and bulk messaging, AI chatbot, shared team inbox, and advanced analytics are made possible. That&#8217;s what makes it so businesses choose to make this change.</span></p>
