<h2 id="message-formats-supported-by-whatsapp-business-api"><b>Message Formats Supported by WhatsApp Business API</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Once you’re aware of which category your message falls into, the next step is to choose a format. WhatsApp API supports various formats that cater to different conversation scenarios. </span></p>
<h3 id="1-free-form-vs-template-messages"><b>1. Free Form vs. Template Messages </b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There are two basic ways to send a message to your customer:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Free-Form messages: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">Personalized messages you can send within the 24-hour customer service window that starts when a customer messages or responds to your business. It is ideal for real-time support or follow-ups.</span></li>
<li aria-level="1"><b>Template Messages: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">These are pre-approved messages that you send outside the 24-hour window. It is mainly used for reminders, shipping updates, and promotional messages. </span></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="2-different-types-text-media-and-other-formats"><b>2. Different Types: Text, Media, and Other Formats</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">WhatsApp API messages are not just limited to text message, it goes far beyond:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Text Message:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> For simple, instant updates or personalized responses. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Media Message:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Share images, PDFs, and documents like receipts, product catalogs, or invoices. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Video Messages:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Perfect format for product demos, tutorials, and marketing campaigns. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Location Messages:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Drop a pin to enable customers to easily find your store or office. Ideal for industries like real estate and logistics. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Contact Messages:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Enable business contact cards within the chat. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Interactive Messages:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Improve customer engagement with </span><a href="/auth/register"><span style="font-weight: 400;">interactive messages</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> that allow you to add a reply button and list menus, enabling customers to reply with just a tap instead of typing.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Choosing the right format makes the real difference. A shipping update might just need a text, but a product launch requires images or a </span><a href="/auth/register"><span style="font-weight: 400;">WhatsApp catalogue</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> to enable customers to browse without leaving the chat. </span></p>
